{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788197800965,"sessionID":"ses_fa71b57adffe2ekWe4aNvJvuc4","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_d9cba35a0e8f4616b040137f","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-d4c726zc/retort-013d5f93d56d/TASK.md"},"output":"<path>/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-d4c726zc/retort-013d5f93d56d/TASK.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: Create a REST API service for managing a book collection.\n2: \n3: Requirements:\n4: - POST /books — Create a new book (title, author, year, isbn)\n5: - GET /books — List all books (support ?author= filter)\n6: - GET /books/{id} — Get a single book by ID\n7: - PUT /books/{id} — Update a book\n8: - DELETE /books/{id} — Delete a book\n9: \n10: Technical constraints:\n11: - Use the specified language and framework\n12: - Store data in SQLite (or language-equivalent embedded DB)\n13: - Return JSON responses with appropriate HTTP status codes\n14: - Include input validation (title and author are required)\n15: - Include a health check endpoint: GET /health\n16: \n17: Deliverables:\n18: - Working source code in the workspace directory\n19: - A README.md with setup and run instructions\n20: - At least 3 unit/integration tests\n\n(End of file - total 20 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"Create a REST API service for managing a book collection.\n\nRequirements:\n- POST /books — Create a new book (title, author, year, isbn)\n- GET /books — List all books (support ?author= filter)\n- GET /books/{id} — Get a single book by ID\n- PUT /books/{id} — Update a book\n- DELETE /books/{id} — Delete a book\n\nTechnical constraints:\n- Use the specified language and framework\n- Store data in SQLite (or language-equivalent embedded DB)\n- Return JSON responses with appropriate HTTP status codes\n- Include input validation (title and author are required)\n- Include a health check endpoint: GET /health\n\nDeliverables:\n- Working source code in the workspace directory\n- A README.md with setup and run instructions\n- At least 3 unit/integration tests","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-d4c726zc/retort-013d5f93d56d/TASK.md","text":"Create a REST API service for managing a book collection.\n\nRequirements:\n- POST /books — Create a new book (title, author, year, isbn)\n- GET /books — List all books (support ?author= filter)\n- GET /books/{id} — Get a single book by ID\n- PUT /books/{id} — Update a book\n- DELETE /books/{id} — Delete a book\n\nTechnical constraints:\n- Use the specified language and framework\n- Store data in SQLite (or language-equivalent embedded DB)\n- Return JSON responses with appropriate HTTP status codes\n- Include input validation (title and author are required)\n- Include a health check endpoint: GET /health\n\nDeliverables:\n- Working source code in the workspace directory\n- A README.md with setup and run instructions\n- At least 3 unit/integration tests","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":20,"totalLines":20,"truncated":false}},"title":"TASK.md","time":{"start":1788197800951,"end":1788197800962}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me read TASK.md first to understand what's being asked.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_058e50bec001ncpio6Bm1xwOl0","sessionID":"ses_fa71b57adffe2ekWe4aNvJvuc4","messageID":"msg_058e4a8fd001evLJzd2bGKw66o"}}
